  cookingInstructions:
  - Mince the garlic.
  - Mince the onion.
  - Slice the ginger
  - Slice the beef shanks.
  - Slice the pork kidney
  - Slice the beef tripe.
  - Slice the pork intestine.
  - Turn the stove to high heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove.
  - Add 1/8 tsp of salt.
  - Add water.
  - Place the sliced beef shanks in the wok.
  - Add the sliced pork intestine.
  - Add the sliced pork kidney.
  - Add the minced garlic.
  - Add the julienned ginger.
  - Add the minced onion.
  - Turn the stove to low heat.
  - Add 1/4 cup of glutinous rice.
  - Add 1/8 tsp of safflower.
  - Add the chicken broth.
  - Saute using the spatula
  - Put the lid on the wok and simmer.
  - Add the sliced beef tripe.
  - Put the lid on the wok and simmer.
